{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"agent_message","text":"The fix restores the reported “store refuses every write” behavior, and completed handles still follow the approved recovery paths. But the new catch also hides retention-only failures when indexing succeeds; those failures produce neither a handle nor a Warning. I’m checking the remaining cross-node dependencies before finalizing that finding.\n"}}
